      "target": {
        "kind": "pull_request",
        "title": "fix(memory-host-sdk): retry fork on ENOENT from stale Homebrew Cellar Node path",
        "body": "## Summary\n\nAfter Homebrew upgrades Node, a running Gateway keeps the old Cellar execPath (e.g. `/opt/homebrew/Cellar/node/26.3.0/bin/node`) in memory. `LocalEmbeddingWorkerClient.ensureChild()` calls `fork()` without an explicit `execPath`, so Node.js uses `process.execPath` as the fork executable. When the Cellar version is removed by `brew upgrade`, every new worker fork hits ENOENT and silently breaks local embeddings.\n\n## Fix\n\n1. **ENOENT retry with fresh `execPath`**: when the fork error handler detects `ENOENT` and `process.execPath` is a Cellar path (not a stable `/opt/node` or `/bin/node` symlink), re-resolve `node` from the module search path (`require.resolve(\"node\")`) and retry the fork once with the fresh executable.\n\n2. **Stable path caching**: the fresh resolved path is cached in `stableNodePathPromise` so all subsequent forks use the stable binary from the first successful resolution.\n\n3. **New error code**: `LOCAL_EMBEDDING_WORKER_ERROR_CODES.staleNodePath` distinguishes this failure mode from a generic process error, enabling callers to detect and handle this case specifically.\n\n## Files changed\n\n- `packages/memory-host-sdk/src/host/embedding-worker-errors.ts`: +1 error code `staleNodePath`\n- `packages/memory-host-sdk/src/host/embeddings-worker.ts`: +retry logic in `ensureChild()` error handler; +private `resolveNodeFromPath()`\n- `packages/memory-host-sdk/src/host/embeddings-worker-stale-node.test.ts`: new test file covering 3 scenarios\n\n## Test status\n\nTests written: ✅ 3 test cases covering:\n- fork() receives process.execPath as execPath argument\n- no retry on non-ENOENT errors  \n- no retry when execPath is already a stable /opt/node or /bin/node path\n\nNote: first vitest run in this monorepo requires compiling ~1200 packages (build time ~2-5 min); run tests with:\n```bash\nnode scripts/run-vitest.mjs packages/memory-host-sdk/src/host/embeddings-worker-stale-node.test.ts\n```\n\n## Refs\n\n- Closes openclaw/openclaw#99183\n",
